    {
      "abstract": "Charged-particle associated yields relative to $\\pi^{0}$ trigger particles versus $\\Delta\\varphi$ in Pb-Pb collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{NN}}$=2.76 TeV. The $\\pi^{0}$ trigger momentum range is     $8< p_{T}^{trig} < 16~GeV/c$, and associated charged particle ranges are $0.5 < p_{T}^{assoc} < 1$, $1 < p_{T}^{assoc} < 2$, $2 < p_{T}^{assoc} < 4$ and $4 < p_{T}^{assoc} < 6~GeV/c$.\n",
